    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0.95,
        "g": 0.95,
        "b": 0.95,
        "fadetime": 0.25,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 2,
        "xstrength": 10,
        "ystrength": 12,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 30,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0.3,
        "r": 0.95,
        "g": 0.95,
        "b": 0.95,
        "fadetime": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_010#2"
    },
    {
        "text": "*huff*...*huff*...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Big Bob"
    },
    {
        "text": "There was... never any turning back for us!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Big Bob"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_220_grani#5"
    },
    {
        "text": "Huh? Carol!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Grani"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playmusic",
        "intro": "$indust_intro",
        "key": "$indust_loop",
        "volume": 0.6,
        "crossfade": 1.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0.95,
        "g": 0.95,
        "b": 0.95,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_263_skadi#2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_003",
        "focus": 1,
        "fadetime": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 3
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_220_grani#5"
    },
    {
        "text": "Skadi!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Grani"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_263_skadi#2",
        "name2": "char_220_grani#5",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Why did you use a non-damaging explosive?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Skadi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_010#2"
    },
    {
        "text": "I owe these girls a favor.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Big Bob"
    },
    {
        "text": "But next time, I'll be using the real ones.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Big Bob"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_263_skadi#2",
        "name2": "char_220_grani#3",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Skadi...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Grani"
    },
    {
        "text": "You don't care about the treasure. Nor do you want to hurt Miss Carol.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Grani"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_263_skadi#2",
        "name2": "char_220_grani#3",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Skadi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_263_skadi#2",
        "name2": "char_220_grani#3",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "That's why you shielded her instead of grabbing the treasure and making a run for it.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Grani"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_263_skadi#2",
        "name2": "char_220_grani#3",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm not after the treasure. What I want is the answer that Carol holds.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Skadi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_263_skadi#2",
        "name2": "char_220_grani#3",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Why didn't you say so in the first place?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Grani"
    },
    {
        "text": "What's the point of playing the villain anyway? Wouldn't kill you to be a bit more frank.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Grani"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_263_skadi#2",
        "name2": "char_220_grani#3",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "I don't want... for others to get caught up in my mission.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Skadi"
    },
    {
        "text": "But the mission objective this time... is very important to me.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Skadi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_263_skadi#2",
        "name2": "char_220_grani#3",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Of course, I can imagine. Even though we have different missions, we're working towards the same thing, right?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Grani"
    },
    {
        "text": "We should be helping each other out instead!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Grani"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_263_skadi#2",
        "name2": "char_220_grani#3",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Tch.",
        "tag": "name",
